      "dom_id": "step-q81605",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Which statement is equivalent to $(P∧Q)∨R?$",
      "worked_solution": "We distribute the disjunction over the conjunction, as follows:\n\n$$\n(P∧Q)∨R≡(P∨R)∧(Q∨R)\n$$",
